---
// Seccion de Contacto con formulario
import background from "../../assets/background/Backgroundcontacto.svg";
---

<section
  class="relative w-full py-15 md:py-20 text-white min-h-screen flex items-center overflow-hidden"
>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none">
    <img
      src={background.src}
      alt="Fondo de servicios"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover object-bottom-right scale-200"
    />
  </div>

  <div
    class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-10 w-full mt-10 lg:px-30 xl:px-10"
  >
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-2 xl:gap-8 items-center">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-12 md:gap-32 -mt-10 md:-mt-25">
        <p
          class="text-brand-gray text-sm md:text-base font-extralight font-body italic leading-tight max-w-60 tracking-tight"
          data-aos="fade-up"
          data-aos-delay="200"
        >
          Si buscas un equipo creativo que piense en tu marca a largo plazo,
          ordene tu comunicación y te acompañe con estrategia y coherencia,
          estamos listos para trabajar contigo.
        </p>

        <h2
          class="text-2xl md:text-4xl leading-[0.95] font-extralight italic font-title tracking-tight"
          data-aos="fade-up"
          data-aos-delay="400"
        >
          <span class="text-brand-coral font-bold">Construyamos</span>
          <br />
          juntos tu marca <br />
          con <span class="text-brand-cyan font-bold">criterio</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="w-full text-right items-end">
        <h3
          class="text-brand-coral text-xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-3"
          data-aos="fade-down"
          data-aos-delay="500"
        >
          Contáctanos
        </h3>

        <div
          class="bg-[#101F72] backdrop-blur-lg border border-white/10 p-2 md:p-3 shadow-2xl"
          data-aos="fade-left"
          data-aos-delay="600"
          data-aos-duration="1000"
        >
          <form
            id="contactForm"
            class="flex flex-col gap-4"
            action="/php/send.php"
            method="POST"
          >
            <input
              type="text"
              name="name"
              placeholder="Nombre y apellido"
              class="bg-[#10247D] border border-blue-900/30 p-4 rounded-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-brand-cyan transition-colors placeholder:text-blue-200/40"
              required
            />
            <input
              type="tel"
              name="phone"
              placeholder="Teléfono"
              class="bg-[#10247D] border border-blue-900/30 p-4 rounded-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-brand-cyan transition-colors placeholder:text-blue-200/40"
            />
            <input
              type="email"
              name="email"
              placeholder="Correo Electrónico"
              class="bg-[#10247D] border border-blue-900/30 p-4 rounded-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-brand-cyan transition-colors placeholder:text-blue-200/40"
              required
            />
            <textarea
              name="message"
              placeholder="Escribir Mensaje"
              rows="4"
              class="bg-[#10247D] border border-blue-900/30 p-4 rounded-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-brand-cyan transition-colors resize-none placeholder:text-blue-200/40"
              required
            ></textarea>
            <input type="text" name="website" style="display:none" />
          </form>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-center md:justify-end mt-4">
          <button
            type="submit" 
            form="contactForm"
            class="bg-brand-coral hover:bg-brand-coral/90 text-sm italic text-white font-normal py-3 px-6 rounded-xl transition-all shadow-lg hover:scale-105 duration-400"
          >
            Conversemos sobre tu marca
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
